# Conclusions in git; evidence and scratch stay on disk.
# Allowlist: nothing in .review-loop/ is tracked unless named below. A new
# durable output type gets its exact name added here, deliberately — never
# `git add -f` around this file. Patterns are exact/dash-prefixed on purpose,
# so Finder duplicates ("REPORT 2.md") and stray scratch stay untracked.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!REPORT.md
!REPORT-*.md
!rounds.md
!rounds-*.md
!ledger.json
!ledger-*.json
!verdict.json
!panel.json
